Hello @StephenPTxEng,

Regarding the issue and the PR, our team has decided that the driver will no longer support **NOR_MEMORY_8B** and this configuration will be deprecated. An update to the driver will be available accordingly.

However, you may keep your proposal and correction; fortunately, your solution will remain available for other customer in such case.
